# Pressing . on a Today entry shows it in the outline under its project, and H returns to Today.
file <<END
Work:
	- Pay rent @due({today-3})
	- Send report @due({today})
	- Plan sprint
Home
END
keys gt j .
see › Work
see - Plan sprint
hide Home
keys x H
see Today
hide Plan sprint
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Pay rent @due({today-3})
	- Send report @due({today}) @done({today})
	- Plan sprint
Home
END
